<section><h2>4. Sensitive memories and other people’s data</h2><p>A personal story may contain special categories of personal data, such as health, religious or political beliefs, ethnic origin, sex life or sexual orientation. The user decides what to tell and should limit information to what is relevant to the project. Anyone adding information, photographs or documents concerning third parties must be entitled to use them lawfully and must respect their dignity, privacy and rights.</p></section>
